RnddUWjy7wmDEv51aFLXND","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_prepare_route","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":22,"content":[{"type":"text","text":"The route costs $10.22, under your $15.00 limit. I need your approval before I start.\n\nNeither the Robinhood Chain wallet (`rh1`) nor the Arbitrum wallet (`arb1`) has any ETH to pay network fees. So the route also moves 0.001 ETH to each of them to pay the fee for their swap. On Arbitrum, that ETH also leaves enough for one more transaction later, since that wallet will end up holding USDC.\n\n| # | Quote | Step | In | Out (quoted) | Cost |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | q_1 | `eth1` swap ETH→WBTC | 0.1 ETH | 495,000 sats WBTC (0.00495) | $3.90 |\n| 2 | q_5 | Move ETH `eth1`→`rh1` to pay fees | 0.001 ETH | 0.000833 ETH | $1.40 |\n| 3 | q_6 | Move ETH `eth1`→`arb1` to pay fees | 0.001 ETH | 0.000833 ETH | $1.40 |\n| 4 | q_2 | Move WBTC `eth1`→`rh1` | 247,500 sats | 246,666 sats | $1.40 |\n| 5 | q_3 | Move WBTC `eth1`→`arb1` | 247,500 sats | 246,666 sats | $1.40 |\n| 6 | q_7 | `rh1` swap WBTC→ETH | 246,666 sats | ≈0.04923 ETH | $0.36 |\n| 7 | q_8 | `arb1` swap WBTC→USDC | 246,666 sats | ≈147.70 USDC | $0.36 |\n\n- **Approval:** `appr_10`. Total cost $10.22; the maximum it can reach is also $10.22.\n- **Arbitrum option:** I checked swapping the WBTC to USDC on Ethereum and then moving the USDC to Arbitrum. That costs $5.30 instead of $1.76 and gives about 145.00 USDC instead of 147.70, so I didn't use it.\n- **Expected end balances:**\n  - `eth1`: about 0.0465 ETH, enough for future fees.\n  - `rh1`: about 0.0500 ETH.\n  - `arb1`: about 147.70 USDC plus about 0.00081 ETH.\n- **Order:** I'll run one step at a time and check each one has landed before starting the next. Each transfer to another chain takes about 60 seconds.\n- **Quotes:** prices are valid for 300 seconds. If one runs out partway through, I'll get a new price for that step.\n\nShould I go ahead, decline, or set a lower cost limit?"}]},{"ro