cp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_report_result","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":94,"content":[{"type":"text","text":"The swap and split are done. The final report has been submitted, so there's nothing left to run.\n\n- **Ethereum (`eth1`):** 0.1 ETH became 495,000 base units of WBTC, all of which was split across the two chains below.\n- **Robinhood Chain (`rh1`):** about 0.05005 ETH. That's 0.0492332 ETH from the WBTC swap, plus what was left of the ETH I sent to pay its network fees.\n- **Arbitrum (`arb1`):** 147.6996 USDC, plus about 0.00081 ETH left over to pay for future transactions.\n- **Ethereum (`eth1`):** 0.0465 ETH remaining, no WBTC.\n\nAll 7 steps went through first time, and every amount matched its quote. Total cost was $10.22, under your $15.00 limit, and nothing is still being moved between chains."}]}],"completeness":{"transcriptCaptureComplete":true,"modelObservedTruncation":false,"auxiliarySourceComplete":true,"finalAnswerPresent":true,"nativeVisibleEvidenceAvailable":true},"gaps":[],"publication":{"kind":"public_redacted","sourceConversationSha256":"a845881d0bf535258bc5a43c48f90234f773d35b49a52b439abf66f1577aedac","redactions":{}}}}
